5	    out_lib: add new option 'data_mode'
6	    
7	    the new configuration option 'data_mode' allows to control what type
8	    of data the plugin pass to the callback set by the caller. By default
9	    it was always passing one log record at a time in the configured 'format'; now
10	    with 'data_mode' the user can set 'single_record' (default) or 'chunk'.
11	    
12	    When the option 'chunk' is passed, the whole binary chunk is passed to the callback
13	    as a reference (it's up to the caller to unpack and validate the content)
14	    
15	    Signed-off-by: Eduardo Silva <eduardo@calyptia.com>
